{
  "name": "Presentation Canvas Workflow",
  "description": "Step-by-step walkthrough of how to use Presentation Canvas, from setup to export",
  "theme": "dark",
  "slides": [
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.container{width:880px;text-align:center;}h1{font-size:52px;margin-bottom:16px;color:#4fc3f7;font-weight:700;}h2{font-size:22px;color:#a0a0b0;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:24px;}.version{display:inline-block;background:#0f3460;color:#4fc3f7;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"version\">VERSION 3.0</div><h1>Presentation Canvas</h1><h2>Your workflow guide — from blank slide to finished deck</h2></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.steps{width:880px;display:flex;gap:16px;}.step{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 16px;text-align:center;}.step-num{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:8px;}.step h3{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:6px;}.step p{font-size:12px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Overview</h2><h1>How It Works</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">1</div><h3>Connect</h3><p>Choose your LLM provider and model</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">2</div><h3>Describe</h3><p>Type what you want in natural language</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">3</div><h3>Generate</h3><p>AI builds slides one at a time as they stream in</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">4</div><h3>Refine</h3><p>Edit, theme, add logo and export</p></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ffca28;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.grid{width:880px;display:flex;gap:20px;}.col{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:24px;}.col h3{font-size:18px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid #4fc3f7;padding-bottom:8px;display:inline-block;}.col ul{list-style:none;padding:0;}.col li{font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:#a0a0b0;padding-left:20px;position:relative;}.col li::before{content:'\\2713';position:absolute;left:0;color:#66bb6a;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Step 1</h2><h1>Connect Your LLM</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"col\"><h3>Ollama (Local)</h3><ul><li>No API key needed</li><li>Privacy-first: data stays local</li><li>Auto-detects installed models</li><li>Default: localhost:11434</li></ul></div><div class=\"col\"><h3>OpenAI / Zhipu</h3><ul><li>Enter your API key in Settings</li><li>GPT-4o, GLM-4, and more</li><li>Best for complex charts</li><li>Requires internet connection</li></ul></div><div class=\"col\"><h3>Custom API</h3><ul><li>Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint</li><li>Works with local or cloud</li><li>Configure base URL + key</li><li>Supports streaming output</li></ul></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#66bb6a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.modes{width:880px;display:flex;gap:20px;}.mode{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:2px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;}.mode.active{border-color:#4fc3f7;}.mode h3{font-size:18px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:10px;}.mode p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#a0a0b0;}.mode .tag{display:inline-block;background:#0f3460;color:#4fc3f7;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:11px;margin-top:10px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Step 2</h2><h1>Choose Your Mode & Format</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"modes\"><div class=\"mode active\"><h3>Generate + Script</h3><p>AI outlines first, then builds each slide. Best for structured, long presentations.</p><div class=\"tag\">RECOMMENDED</div></div><div class=\"mode\"><h3>Generate + Slides</h3><p>AI builds slides directly. Fastest path from idea to deck.</p><div class=\"tag\">FASTEST</div></div><div class=\"mode\"><h3>Generate + Markdown</h3><p>AI creates markdown outline, then converts to slides.</p><div class=\"tag\">STRUCTURED</div></div><div class=\"mode\"><h3>Edit Mode</h3><p>Select a slide and describe changes. AI edits that slide in place.</p><div class=\"tag\">REFINE</div></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.prompt-box{width:880px;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;}.prompt-box h3{font-size:16px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:16px;}.prompt{background:#0f3460;border-left:3px solid #4fc3f7;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:15px;color:#e0e0e0;line-height:1.5;font-family:'Consolas',monospace;}.prompt .keyword{color:#ffca28;font-weight:600;}.tip{font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.6;}.tip strong{color:#66bb6a;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Step 3</h2><h1>Describe Your Presentation</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"prompt-box\"><h3>Example Prompts — keywords trigger special chart types automatically</h3><div class=\"prompt\">\"Create a 5-slide <span class=\"keyword\">gov bid</span> deck for cybersecurity\"</div><div class=\"prompt\">\"Build a <span class=\"keyword\">Gantt chart</span> for project timeline Q3-Q4\"</div><div class=\"prompt\">\"Generate a <span class=\"keyword\">RACI matrix</span> with <span class=\"keyword\">risk matrix</span> for the dev team\"</div><div class=\"prompt\">\"Make a <span class=\"keyword\">SWOT</span> analysis with <span class=\"keyword\">KPI dashboard</span>\"</div><div class=\"tip\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Max Slides to control deck length. Add a Footer Label for classification markings like \"CUI\".</div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.triggers{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}.trigger{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;}.trigger .kw{font-size:13px;color:#ffca28;font-weight:600;font-family:'Consolas',monospace;}.trigger .name{font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:4px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Global Trigger System</h2><h1>13 Keyword-Activated Chart Types</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"triggers\"><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">gov bid, proposal, RFP</div><div class=\"name\">Government Bid Mode</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">Gantt, project schedule</div><div class=\"name\">Gantt Chart</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">RACI, responsibility matrix</div><div class=\"name\">RACI Matrix</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">cost, budget, pricing</div><div class=\"name\">Cost / Pricing Table</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">bar chart, column chart</div><div class=\"name\">Bar / Column Chart</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">pie chart, donut chart</div><div class=\"name\">Pie / Donut Chart</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">SWOT</div><div class=\"name\">SWOT Analysis</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">KPI, dashboard, scorecard</div><div class=\"name\">KPI Dashboard</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">org chart, hierarchy</div><div class=\"name\">Org Chart</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">quad chart, 2x2</div><div class=\"name\">Quad Chart</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">timeline, roadmap</div><div class=\"name\">Timeline</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">risk matrix, risk assessment</div><div class=\"name\">Risk Matrix</div></div><div class=\"trigger\"><div class=\"kw\">feature comparison, vs</div><div class=\"name\">Comparison Table</div></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#66bb6a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.features{width:880px;display:flex;gap:20px;}.feature{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;}.feature h3{font-size:16px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:10px;}.feature p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#a0a0b0;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Smart Layout Engine</h2><h1>Every Slide, Perfectly Framed</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature\"><h3>CSS Variables</h3><p>Every slide defines --slide-width, --slide-height, --safe-margin, --header-height, --footer-height for consistent sizing.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3>Safe Margins</h3><p>40px left/right, 35px top/bottom. Content never touches the edges. max-width:880px on all text containers.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3>Smart Centering</h3><p>Title slides center in full height. Content slides center between header and footer zones using flexbox.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3>Format-Aware</h3><p>Default 960x540px (16:9 Letter). A4 and print formats recognized. Works in browser and PPTX export.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ff9800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.refine{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}.item{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;}.item h3{font-size:16px;color:#ff9800;margin-bottom:8px;}.item p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#a0a0b0;}.item .key{font-size:12px;color:#4fc3f7;font-family:'Consolas',monospace;margin-top:8px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Step 4</h2><h1>Refine Your Deck</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"refine\"><div class=\"item\"><h3>Edit Mode</h3><p>Select a slide and describe changes in natural language. AI edits only that slide while keeping the rest intact.</p><div class=\"key\">\"Change title to Q4 Results\"</div></div><div class=\"item\"><h3>5 Themes</h3><p>Dark, Light, Blue, Green, Red. Swap instantly — all slides update live. Theme also guides AI color choices.</p><div class=\"key\">Applies to all existing slides immediately</div></div><div class=\"item\"><h3>Logo System</h3><p>Upload once, choose position and size, apply to every slide with one click. Remove just as easily.</p><div class=\"key\">Top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right</div></div><div class=\"item\"><h3>Footer Labels</h3><p>Type \"CUI\" or \"Company Sensitive\" — auto-injected into every slide as a subtle footer. Included in edit prompts too.</p><div class=\"key\">Auto-applies after 600ms debounce</div></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ef5350;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#ffffff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.exports{width:880px;display:flex;gap:20px;}.export-card{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:24px;text-align:center;}.export-card h3{font-size:20px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:10px;}.export-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#a0a0b0;}.export-card .icon{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:8px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Step 5</h2><h1>Export & Deliver</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"exports\"><div class=\"export-card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128196;</div><h3>PDF</h3><p>Print-optimized. Set margins to None and enable Background Graphics for dark themes.</p></div><div class=\"export-card\"><div class=\"icon">&#128640;</div><h3>PPTX</h3><p>Each slide becomes a high-res image in PowerPoint. Full visual fidelity, not text-editable.</p></div><div class=\"export-card\"><div class=\"icon">&#128187;</div><h3>HTML</h3><p>Download any session as a standalone viewer HTML file. Self-contained, no server needed.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.container{width:880px;text-align:center;}h1{font-size:44px;margin-bottom:16px;color:#ffffff;}.accent{width:60px;height:3px;background:#4fc3f7;margin:0 auto 20px;}.features{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;}.feature{background:rgba(79,195,247,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(79,195,247,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 22px;font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;}.feature strong{color:#4fc3f7;}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><h1>Start Creating</h1><div class=\"accent\"></div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#a0a0b0;margin-bottom:8px;\">Connect your LLM. Describe your deck. Refine. Export.</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#4fc3f7;\">github.com/norhtecmbarnes-dot/presentation-canvas</div><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature\"><strong>Privacy-first</strong><br>No cloud, no accounts</div><div class=\"feature\"><strong>13 chart types</strong><br>Triggered by keywords</div><div class=\"feature\"><strong>Smart layout</strong><br>Auto-centered & safe margins</div><div class=\"feature\"><strong>Session history</strong><br>Auto-saved in browser</div></div></div></body></html>"
  ]
